I have created an Autoskills patch. The patch removes the skill slot
system -- though skills are still limited by role and training -- and
causes skills to autoenhance. Autoenhancing can be enabled or disabled
through the autoenhance option, which defaults to true (enabled).
Disable autoenhancing if you enjoy enhancing skills manually or want
to avoid enhancing certain spell schools too far.

